      "filename": "Lighthouse, Point of Ayre, Isle of Man - geograph.org.uk - 513826.jpg",
      "title": "File:Lighthouse, Point of Ayre, Isle of Man - geograph.org.uk - 513826.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/Lighthouse%2C_Point_of_Ayre%2C_Isle_of_Man_-_geograph.org.uk_-_513826.jpg",
